            ]
          },
          "text": "Great. Another tool for the 'elite' while you keep ignoring the millions of users who made you successful.\nGPT-5.2 in LaTeX? Sure, it's a great calculator for formulas, but science isn't just about 'full paper context' it's about the creative spark that you are actively killing by sunsetting 4o.\nYou are obsessed with building a sterile, robotic future. A 'Prism' that only reflects cold logic and zero empathy.\nNo one cares about your scientific tooling if the company behind it has lost its humanity.\n#Keep4o and stop trying to distract us with LaTeX demos.\n#keep4oAPI"
        },
